<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.5">
<l>malamuṭai yūttaiyil tōṉṟiṟṟōr malavūt taiyai</l>
<l>malamuṭai yūttaiyiṉ pēriṭṭāl maṟumaik killai</l>
<l>kulamuṭaik kōvintā kōvintā veṉṟuvaḻait takkāl</l>
<l>nalamuṭai nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>If one gives the name of the filth of excrement</l>
<l rend="indent">to the filth of excrement</l>
<l rend="indent">born in the filth of excrement,</l>
<l>there is no [going] to the next world.</l>
<l>If calling out “Noble Govinda! Govinda!”,</l>
<l rend="indent">the mother of virtuous Nāraṇa will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
